      "message": "The exit status with only warnings is undefined. The text gives 0 for \"no diagnostic at `warn` or above\" and 1 for a `deny` or a compile error, but says nothing about warnings alone. Most linters exit 0 there and offer a flag to fail on warnings, which item 6\u0027s per-run level flag already allows (raise to `deny`). Spelling that out would settle it.",
